 "stimulus_html": "<p>For questions 1 – 4 use the problem below:</p>\n<blockquote>\nPriya is buying raisins and almonds to make trail mix. Almonds cost $5.20 per pound and raisins cost $2.75 per pound. Priya spent $11.70 buying almonds and raisins. The relationship between pounds of almonds, pounds of raisins, and the total cost is represented by the equation <span data-math=\"5.2a+2.75r=11.7\">5.2a+2.75r=11.7</span>.</blockquote><br>",
